HB0315 K-12 public education reorganization.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Andrew and Senator(s) Driskill and
Scott
AN ACT relating to the administration of government; requiring a plan to
reorganize the state board of education and the state board of career and
technical education under the state superintendent of public instruction;
specifying elements of the plan; requiring reports; requiring legislative
approval; and providing for an effective date.
